  "siteSettingsClearSiteDataBody": "Isto borra as cookies, localStorage, IndexedDB, ServiceWorkers e a caché HTTP deste sitio. O sitio recargarase cun contedor baleiro novo.",
  "siteSettingsClearCookiesBody": "Seguro que queres borrar todas as cookies deste sitio?",
